### Smart Loan Tracker API - Message Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = your-auth-token-here
@loanId = loan-id-here

### Get Messages for Loan
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/loans/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Send Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "content": "Hello, when can you make the payment?"
}

### Get Unread Message Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Recent Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/recent
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Recent Messages - With Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/recent?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

